    'A complete 5-module training program covering battery types, Ontario''s RPRA Batteries Regulation, lithium-ion fire safety, and correct recycling procedures. Built on official RPRA data, Ontario Fire Marshal safety guidance, and Toronto Fire Services incident reporting — designed for Ontario residents, businesses, property managers, educators, and community advocates.',
